# --- Wayland Session Support (optional, opt-in via session config) ---
# labwc: stacking Wayland compositor (Openbox-style, wlroots-based)
# xwayland: X11 application compatibility under Wayland
# qtwayland5: native Qt5 Wayland platform plugin (enables PyQt shell)
# swaybg: Wayland wallpaper utility (replaces feh/nitrogen in Wayland mode)
# swaylock, swayidle: Screen lock and idle management for Wayland
labwc
xwayland
qtwayland5
swaybg
swaylock
swayidle

# --- Authentication & Security ---
